flowchart TD
  Actor[Public visitor / member / organization / admin] --> UI[React UI and TanStack file routes]
  UI --> Query[React Query and Supabase client]
  UI --> Worker[TanStack Start server / Cloudflare worker build]
  Query --> Auth[Supabase Auth]
  Query --> DB[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]
  Worker --> DB
  DB --> Policy[RLS policies, triggers and database functions]
  Payment[Payment provider - live integration unverified] -. webhook / payment events .-> Worker
  Worker --> Ledger[Payment and financial history - schema/flow to verify]
